{"id":"b1e5640471f82a1d","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-randomized-communication-complexity.md","title":"Randomized Communication Complexity","display":"df-randomized-communication-complexity — Randomized Communication Complexity","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-randomized-communication-complexity","aliases":["28-df-randomized-communication-complexity","Randomized Communication Complexity"],"display":"df-randomized-communication-complexity — Randomized Communication Complexity","depends_on":["[[28-df-communication-protocol]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §13.4; explicit worst-case and expected-cost variants","source_printed_pages":"280–281","source_pdf_pages":"306–307","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-randomized-communication-complexity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-randomized-communication-complexity</span><span>Randomized Communication Complexity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-randomized-communication-complexity — Randomized Communication Complexity"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"35827b4b6670766d\" href=\"?note=35827b4b6670766d\" title=\"28-df-communication-protocol\">28-df-communication-protocol</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §13.4; explicit worst-case and expected-cost variants"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"280–281"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"306–307"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\">\\(X,Y\\)</span> 有限非空，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:X\\times Y\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(f:X\\times Y\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon\\in[0,1/2)\">\\(\\varepsilon\\in[0,1/2)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Comm},\\operatorname{out},\\operatorname{cost}\">\\(\\operatorname{Comm},\\operatorname{out},\\operatorname{cost}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"35827b4b6670766d\" href=\"?note=35827b4b6670766d\" title=\"28-df-communication-protocol\">28-df-communication-protocol</a>；公开随机协议是有限均匀随机串选择的确定型协议族 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\Pi_r)_{r\\in\\{0,1\\}^{\\ell}}\">\\((\\Pi_r)_{r\\in\\{0,1\\}^{\\ell}}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>上标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{pub}\">\\(\\mathrm{pub}\\)</span> 标识公共随机币；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 标识随机带期望成本。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_\\varepsilon(f)\\coloneqq\\{(\\ell,(\\Pi_r)_r):\\ell\\in\\mathbb N,\\ \\forall r\\in\\{0,1\\}^\\ell\\ \\Pi_r\\in\\operatorname{Comm}(X,Y),\\ \\forall(x,y)\\in X\\times Y\\ 2^{-\\ell}\\sum_{r\\in\\{0,1\\}^\\ell}\\mathbf1[\\operatorname{out}_{\\Pi_r}(x,y)\\ne f(x,y)]\\le\\varepsilon\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal R_\\varepsilon(f)\\coloneqq\\{(\\ell,(\\Pi_r)_r):\\ell\\in\\mathbb N,\\ \\forall r\\in\\{0,1\\}^\\ell\\ \\Pi_r\\in\\operatorname{Comm}(X,Y),\\ \\forall(x,y)\\in X\\times Y\\ 2^{-\\ell}\\sum_{r\\in\\{0,1\\}^\\ell}\\mathbf1[\\operatorname{out}_{\\Pi_r}(x,y)\\ne f(x,y)]\\le\\varepsilon\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"R^{\\mathrm{pub}}_\\varepsilon(f)\\coloneqq\\min_{(\\ell,(\\Pi_r)_r)\\in\\mathcal R_\\varepsilon(f)}\\max_{(x,y,r)\\in X\\times Y\\times\\{0,1\\}^\\ell}\\operatorname{cost}_{\\Pi_r}(x,y).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[R^{\\mathrm{pub}}_\\varepsilon(f)\\coloneqq\\min_{(\\ell,(\\Pi_r)_r)\\in\\mathcal R_\\varepsilon(f)}\\max_{(x,y,r)\\in X\\times Y\\times\\{0,1\\}^\\ell}\\operatorname{cost}_{\\Pi_r}(x,y).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"R^{\\mathrm{pub},E}_\\varepsilon(f)\\coloneqq\\inf_{(\\ell,(\\Pi_r)_r)\\in\\mathcal R_\\varepsilon(f)}\\max_{(x,y)\\in X\\times Y}2^{-\\ell}\\sum_{r\\in\\{0,1\\}^\\ell}\\operatorname{cost}_{\\Pi_r}(x,y).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[R^{\\mathrm{pub},E}_\\varepsilon(f)\\coloneqq\\inf_{(\\ell,(\\Pi_r)_r)\\in\\mathcal R_\\varepsilon(f)}\\max_{(x,y)\\in X\\times Y}2^{-\\ell}\\sum_{r\\in\\{0,1\\}^\\ell}\\operatorname{cost}_{\\Pi_r}(x,y).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>两种成本分别是随机带最坏情形和随机带期望；对输入都取最坏情形，错误也逐输入受限。书 §13.4 使用期望通信量；这里保留原有 worst-case 记号并另给 E 版本，避免静默混同。允许任意有限随机带长度；确定型协议保证优化集合非空。期望量用下确界，以免未达最小值时造出函数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>来源：§13.4; explicit worst-case and expected-cost variants，印刷页 280–281；PDF 页 306–307。已比对相应定义或陈述；形式编码与边界条件在本节点内展开。 本次未完整复核原书证明。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-communication-protocol","status":"resolved","id":"35827b4b6670766d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-communication-protocol]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-communication-protocol","status":"resolved","id":"35827b4b6670766d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Comm},\\operatorname{out},\\operatorname{cost}$ 见 [[28-df-communication-protocol]]；公开随机协议是有限均匀随机串选择的确定型协议族 $(\\Pi_r)_{r\\in\\{0,1\\}^{\\ell}}$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"X,Y","display":false},{"tex":"f:X\\times Y\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varepsilon\\in[0,1/2)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Comm},\\operatorname{out},\\operatorname{cost}","display":false},{"tex":"(\\Pi_r)_{r\\in\\{0,1\\}^{\\ell}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{pub}","display":false},{"tex":"E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal R_\\varepsilon(f)\\coloneqq\\{(\\ell,(\\Pi_r)_r):\\ell\\in\\mathbb N,\\ \\forall r\\in\\{0,1\\}^\\ell\\ \\Pi_r\\in\\operatorname{Comm}(X,Y),\\ \\forall(x,y)\\in X\\times Y\\ 2^{-\\ell}\\sum_{r\\in\\{0,1\\}^\\ell}\\mathbf1[\\operatorname{out}_{\\Pi_r}(x,y)\\ne f(x,y)]\\le\\varepsilon\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"R^{\\mathrm{pub}}_\\varepsilon(f)\\coloneqq\\min_{(\\ell,(\\Pi_r)_r)\\in\\mathcal R_\\varepsilon(f)}\\max_{(x,y,r)\\in X\\times Y\\times\\{0,1\\}^\\ell}\\operatorname{cost}_{\\Pi_r}(x,y).","display":true},{"tex":"R^{\\mathrm{pub},E}_\\varepsilon(f)\\coloneqq\\inf_{(\\ell,(\\Pi_r)_r)\\in\\mathcal R_\\varepsilon(f)}\\max_{(x,y)\\in X\\times Y}2^{-\\ell}\\sum_{r\\in\\{0,1\\}^\\ell}\\operatorname{cost}_{\\Pi_r}(x,y).","display":true}],"bytes":2374,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-177","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"通信模型：[[28-df-communication-protocol]]、[[28-df-deterministic-communication-complexity]]、[[28-df-randomized-communication-complexity]]。"}],"outgoing":["35827b4b6670766d"]}